mactelnet-proxy (0.1.2) stable; urgency=low

  * L2 destination is the target's MAC, not broadcast — matches
    upstream interfaces.c:net_send_udp; allows traversal of
    intermediate L2 paths with broadcast suppression / hardware
    MAC-rule filtering on UDP/20561

