mactelnet-proxy (0.1.0) stable; urgency=low

  * initial pre-release build
  * MNDP discovery (UDP/5678) with TLV parser
  * MAC-Telnet protocol (UDP/20561) — EC-SRP and MD5 auth, terminal
    size negotiation, sequence/ACK retransmit, keepalive
  * embedded SSH server (key-auth only) routing exec requests to
    in-process mactelnet/mndp engines
  * configurable retransmit budgets, raw L2 send via PF_PACKET so
    src=0.0.0.0 actually lands on the wire

 -- Icosa Consulting <build@icosa.consulting>  Thu, 01 May 2026 00:00:00 -0600
